abstract: >-
  This repository hosts the Jupyter Notebook of a Toy
  Machine Learning model that will be used as an example of
  FAIR principles applied to AI models at a very basic
  level. In particular, it contains a basic ML model, i.e.,
  a classifier trained on the Iris dataset with the
  k-neighbors algorithm.
